 <name>HTML_QuickForm2_Captcha</name>
 <channel>pear.php.net</channel>
 <summary>Captcha package for QuickForm2</summary>
 <description>Provides anti-spam measures for forms built with QuickForm2
  by adding a security question that hopefully only humans
  can answer.

  Available plugins:
  - ReCaptcha.net
  - Mathematical questions (numeral captcha)</description>
